Package: jaspTrajectories
Type: Package
Title: Latent Class Growth and Growth Mixture Models for JASP
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Daniel", "Corcoran", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "particleapps@proton.me")
Description: A focused JASP interface to the existing lcmm estimators for
    continuous and ordinal longitudinal outcomes. Fits latent class growth
    analyses and growth mixture models, with polynomial time effects,
    model summaries, posterior classification and trajectory plots.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: lcmm (== 2.2.2), jaspBase, ggplot2, stats, utils
URL: https://github.com/particle-apps
Contact: Daniel Corcoran <particleapps@proton.me>
NeedsCompilation: no

